Description: Lightweight, native Discord client (unofficial)
 MaiCord draws its own interface on the GPU; there is no Electron, browser
 engine or web view. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by
 Discord Inc.
 .
 This package installs the upstream release program, which is built from the
 source at https://github.com/maj113/MaiCord with LLVM 23 (the Ubuntu archive
 has no such compiler), so the source package carries the release tarball and
 does not compile anything.
